<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0 }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 88, background: '#0E3F8C', width: '100%', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 40, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ color: '#FFFFFF', fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>提交方式（单一 push）</Text>
    <Text style={{ color: '#FFFFFF', fontSize: 16, opacity: 0.8 }}>JS 前端 · 项目三</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', flex: 1, padding: 32, gap: 28 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 560, background: '#0F172A', borderRadius: 8, padding: 18 }}>
      <CodeBlock
        code={`git add -A
git commit -m "项目三：商品批量统计 aggregate"
git push origin master`}
        language='javascript'
        width={524}
        fontSize={15}
      />
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, gap: 16 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>记住两点</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>
        • 仓库名保持 <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>js-course</span>，不用改名。<br />
        • 老师按你的 Gitee 账号识别提交，<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>不用单独发链接</span>。<br />
        • 只 push，不发包链 / 不 PR。
      </Text>
      <Box style={{ background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: 16, marginTop: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>push 前务必先跑通自检，再提交干净版本。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 40, paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>JS 前端 · 项目三 · 商品批量统计实训</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#0E3F8C' }}>07 / 08</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
